Package: com.551.obdelevenupdatebypass
Name: OBDeleven Update Bypass
Version: 1.0.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Bypasses the forced Update Required gate in regular OBDeleven 1.11.0 by spoofing only the app's main bundle version/build values so its own update checker follows the normal ready path.
Maintainer: 551
Author: 551
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), ellekit
